WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.433
Responsible digital participation includes respecting privacy, seeking consent where appropriate and limiting unnecessary data collection.

00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:13.379
Public availability does not automatically justify every use of a person’s information.

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:19.325
A classroom platform should distinguish public learning material from private student records.

00:00:20.325 --> 00:00:27.964
Consider whether identifiable student results need to be public, the school’s rules, required consent and a less identifying alternative.

00:00:27.964 --> 00:00:33.995
A screenshot can reveal more than its central message, including account details at the edges.

00:00:34.995 --> 00:00:36.578
What is data minimisation?

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:40.535
Minimisation limits collection to what is necessary for the purpose.
